WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.237
Bulgaria is a country nestled in the southeastern corner of Europe.

2
00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:09.321
Not much is heard about it on the news, and it is still largely undiscovered by tourists.

3
00:00:09.322 --> 00:00:12.522
It lies north of Greece and south of the Danube River.

4
00:00:12.523 --> 00:00:17.639
To its east is the Black Sea, and its neighbor to the west is Serbia.

5
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:21.382
Bulgaria is one of the oldest settled lands in all of Europe.

6
00:00:21.383 --> 00:00:26.286
It has a rich history and diverse customs, and its people are proud of their heritage.

7
00:00:26.287 --> 00:00:30.859
The Bulgarians have a rich tradition of celebrating festivals and gatherings.

8
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:36.465
In the past Bulgaria was largely an agricultural nation because of its fertile soil.

9
00:00:36.466 --> 00:00:42.100
It produced an abundance of vegetables, fruits, grain, and products from farm animals.

10
00:00:42.101 --> 00:00:46.137
Today the country is industrialized, and many products are imported.

11
00:00:46.138 --> 00:00:50.851
Local farms, however, continue to grow a variety of harvests.

12
00:00:50.852 --> 00:00:56.866
The Bulgarian people continue to grow one item that has perfume companies from Paris to New York talking.

13
00:00:56.867 --> 00:01:00.127
It is very hard to produce, and it is very expensive.

14
00:01:00.128 --> 00:01:11.138
It is the pure rose oil extracted from a small pink rose named Rosa damascene , and it is an important ingredient in many

15
00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:14.060
perfumes. In the center of Bulgaria lies the Valley of the

16
00:01:14.061 --> 00:01:21.053
Roses. It is a fertile valley covered in tiny pink roses whose sweet aroma can be felt like a perfume in the

17
00:01:21.054 --> 00:01:25.374
air. The valley’s moderate climate allows the roses to grow in perfect

18
00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:30.369
conditions. The local people have been cultivating these unique flowers for hundreds of

19
00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:35.390
years. The farmers who live in the valley pick the roses when they start to bloom in the beginning of

20
00:01:35.391 --> 00:01:43.844
June. They gather the tiny buds very early in the morning, just before sunrise, because that is when the roses are still fresh and full of

21
00:01:43.845 --> 00:01:50.014
dew. Traditionally, it was the young girls and women who harvested the roses and collected them in their

22
00:01:50.015 --> 00:01:53.802
baskets. They would put the very first flower they picked in their hair for

23
00:01:53.803 --> 00:01:58.902
decoration. While they worked, they sang the traditional songs sung every year during the rose

24
00:01:58.903 --> 00:02:05.388
harvest. Today the production is much faster, but the roses are still picked by hand by local

25
00:02:05.389 --> 00:02:11.077
farmers. After the roses are picked, they are rushed to the rose distillery before the sun has a chance to dry

26
00:02:11.078 --> 00:02:15.816
them. Their petals are collected in large pots and pressed to extract tiny amounts of oil.

27
00:02:15.817 --> 00:02:21.319
It takes almost two tons of petals to produce just one pound of pure rose oil.

28
00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.674
The rose oil is very aromatic and very expensive.

29
00:02:24.675 --> 00:02:26.956
It is even more expensive than gold.

30
00:02:26.957 --> 00:02:34.769
Besides its use in perfumes, rose oil is used in medicines, cosmetics, soaps, and even in rose petal jam!

31
00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:42.159
Today picking the prized blossoms is the main industry in the Rose Valley, and this industry continues to grow.

32
00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:46.606
Every year the first day of picking is celebrated with an annual Rose Festival.

33
00:02:46.607 --> 00:02:50.225
This daylong festival is usually held in the first week of June.

34
00:02:50.226 --> 00:02:54.449
The pickers wear their traditional costumes decorated with garlands of roses.

35
00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.382
They hold a beauty contest and choose a Rose Queen.

36
00:02:57.383 --> 00:03:03.666
Later when the harvest is over, the Rose Queen rewards the most skilled picker with a crown.

37
00:03:03.667 --> 00:03:11.265
The title of Rose Queen is an important honor for the lucky girl who receives it, and the festival itself has become a celebration of beauty.

38
00:03:11.266 --> 00:03:16.135
Since roses are a symbol of beauty and because the flowers are used in the beauty industry,

39
00:03:16.136 --> 00:03:20.240
the festival organizers felt that they needed to nominate a beauty queen.

40
00:03:20.241 --> 00:03:23.252
That’s how the Rose Queen was born.

41
00:03:23.253 --> 00:03:30.232
Many Bulgarian actors, musicians, and circus performers flock to the Rose Valley every year to perform in the festival.

42
00:03:30.233 --> 00:03:35.215
It has even become an international destination for tourists from all over the world.

43
00:03:35.216 --> 00:03:42.444
The Rose Festival ends with a carnival where local people dress up in costumes and dance all night long.

44
00:03:42.445 --> 00:03:47.570
The very first Rose Festival was held in 1903 in the nearby town of Kazanlak.

45
00:03:47.571 --> 00:03:54.540
It slowly grew from a small gathering of rose pickers to a national event with many towns and villages participating.

46
00:03:54.541 --> 00:04:01.450
It keeps the traditions associated with the rose harvest alive, and it makes the local farmers very proud of their labor.

47
00:04:01.451 --> 00:04:08.101
Bulgarians are very proud of their rose oil production, which carries the name of their country far and beyond.

48
00:04:08.102 --> 00:04:15.403
They feel that the rose is the queen of all flowers, and that is why they have picked it to be their national flower.

49
00:04:15.404 --> 00:04:18.821
Today the Rose Festival and the harvest go hand in hand.

50
00:04:18.822 --> 00:04:22.472
Local people gather to celebrate the beautiful tradition of rose picking,

51
00:04:22.473 --> 00:04:29.856
and international companies continue to import the best rose oil in the world from the Valley of the Roses.

